<view class="page">
  <view wx:if="{{success}}" class="success">
    <view class="success-symbol">✓</view>
    <text class="eyebrow">SEE YOU OUTSIDE</text>
    <view class="title">山野见！</view>
    <view class="muted">
      你已成功报名「{{activity.title}}」
      <view />
      出发时间 {{activity.dateText}}
    </view>
    <view class="notice">
      报名成功不代表活动安排不会变化。出发前请再次核对活动详情。
    </view>
    <button class="primary" bindtap="done">查看活动安排</button>
    <button class="secondary" bindtap="myActivities">我的报名</button>
  </view>
  <block wx:else>
    <text class="eyebrow">ONE STEP CLOSER TO THE OUTSIDE</text>
    <view class="title">为出发，留个位置。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="state">正在确认活动…</view>
    <view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="state error">
      {{error}}
      <button class="secondary" bindtap="retry">重试</button>
    </view>
    <block wx:elif="{{activity}}">
      <view class="booking-summary">
        <text class="badge">免费报名 · 无需支付</text>
        <view class="booking-title">{{activity.title}}</view>
        <view class="muted">{{activity.dateText}} · {{activity.location}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="field">
        <text class="label">参加人姓名</text>
        <input
          value="{{name}}"
          maxlength="40"
          placeholder="请填写真实参加人姓名"
          bindinput="inputName"
          disabled="{{submitting}}"
        />
      </view>
      <view class="field">
        <text class="label">联系手机号</text>
        <input
          value="{{phone}}"
          type="number"
          maxlength="11"
          placeholder="便于主理人联系活动安排"
          bindinput="inputPhone"
          disabled="{{submitting}}"
        />
      </view>
      <checkbox-group bindchange="consentChange">
        <label class="consent">
          <checkbox
            value="yes"
            checked="{{consent}}"
            color="#193F34"
            disabled="{{submitting}}"
          />
          <text>
            我同意将姓名和手机号提供给活动主理人，仅用于本次活动组织与联系。
          </text>
        </label>
      </checkbox-group>
      <view class="privacy" bindtap="privacy">阅读报名信息使用说明 ↗</view>
      <view class="notice">
        点击报名时将通过微信登录识别你的账号。不会获取微信密码，也不会自动发起支付。每个微信账号每场活动限一个有效名额。
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{fieldError}}" class="error form-error">
        {{fieldError}}
      </view>
      <button
        class="primary submit"
        loading="{{submitting}}"
        disabled="{{submitting || !activity.enabled}}"
        bindtap="submit"
      >
        {{submitting ? '正在确认名额…' : activity.label}}
      </button>
      <view class="muted small center">
        报名失败不代表名额已确认，请以成功页面或我的报名为准。
      </view>
    </block>
  </block>
</view>
